  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p>建立自己的伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但使用 BisectHosting，只需幾下點擊就能擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供 24/7 全天候支援與快速回應，絕無任何問題能阻擋您！有興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💌 贊助</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 上贊助</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上贊助</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1>熔煉附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/smelting-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"授權條款\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<p>為礦鎬新增的 <code>熔煉</code> 附魔，可自動熔煉挖掘到的礦石。</p>\n<p>此附魔可透過附魔台、戰利品寶箱或與村民交易獲得。</p>\n<p>與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-veinminer-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Veinminer</a> 及 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmagnetic-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magnetic</a> 附魔相容！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 不相容項目</h2>\n<p>以下項目不相容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Despawn Timer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤 / 問題</h2>\n<p>請於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 回報任何問題、錯誤或缺陷。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot smelting_enchantment:smelting</code></pre>\n<p>賦予：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s smelting_enchantment:smelting</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>",
